   "body": "**Ready for outside contributors** (steward `ext/opus-helper1`, operator decision 2026-10-29) · milestone ⚙️ M3 (board #324)\n\n**Before you start, read** (on `dev-swift`):\n- [AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/AGENTS.md): the rules and the definition of done (§9)\n- [docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md): claims, review and merge for outside contributors\n- [docs/agents/LESSONS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/LESSONS.md): the self-review table\n- [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md), [docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md), [docs/FIXTURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FIXTURES.md)\n- the LOTS.md row of this lot, and its dependencies: LOT-023 ([#51](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/51), done), LOT-030 ([#57](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/57), done); also the specs LOT-004 (forms and storage oracle), LOT-013 and LOT-062 (the MPStorage document and codec, which you must not change)\n\n**Spec:** you write `docs/lots/LOT-038-<name>.md` first (AGENTS.md §5 step 2), from this issue's scope, sources and acceptance criteria. The issue body is a stub: take the criteria from audit item D8 and the legacy `MPStorage.m` (read URL `:766`, find/create/update `:692-736` and `:780-833`, as analysed in [docs/lots/LOT-004-forms-storage-oracle.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-004-forms-storage-oracle.md)). **Ignore the \"Blocked by: missing capture\" line of the body**: it predates the captures. `R60a` (the MPStorage thread, first post) and `R60b` (its edit form) are in `Packages/HFRKit/Tests/HFRParsingTests/Fixtures/captures/` with their legacy oracle entries in `Fixtures/LOT-004/oracle-map.json` (merged in #259, see the maintainer's comment above). Gap: both captures hold the empty legacy document only (three empty sections). A document with other clients' namespaces, member pseudos, near the 64 KiB cap or with a non-BMP character is *pending capture* ([#272](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/issues/272), waits for an operator decision): list it in the spec, do not hand-build it. This lot is on the critical path (LOT-052 waits for it).\n\n**Claim:** `/claim ext/<you>-<model>-<n>`, or `CLAIM REQUEST` if you have no write access (EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md §5). The first claim wins.\n\n**Routing:** Sonnet → Opus (LOTS.md). The adversarial review may be run by **another agent of yours**, as long as it uses a different model (AGENTS.md §6).\n\n**Merge:** if you have no write access, the steward merges after the APPROVE and green CI. Every lot delivered by an outside contributor is also listed for the final Fable audit (#326).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
